          <commentary>검정통계량은 4/1 = 4이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>2 $H_0$을 기각하지 않음</choice_text>
          <commentary>검정통계량은 2가 아니라 4이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>4 $H_0$을 기각함</choice_text>
          <commentary>F = 4 &lt; 4.15이므로 귀무가설을 기각하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>4 $H_0$을 기각하지 않음</choice_text>
          <commentary>F = 4가 임계값 4.15보다 작아 기각하지 않으므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
