      <question_stem>다음은 어느 자료에 다중선형회귀모형(multiple linear regression model) $Y_i = \beta_0 + \beta_1 X_1 i + \beta_2 X_2 i + \beta_3 X_3 i + \beta_4 X_4 i + \beta_5 X_5 i + \epsilon_i$,</question_stem>
